    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      280.03,
      455.9,
      336.62
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause inserts new sections 24A, 24B, 24C, 24D, and 24E to the Commissionsof Inquiry Act (Chapter 393) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and thelegal effect of the sections as inserted is to provide for the Commission to InvestigateAllegations of Bribery or Corruption to consider material collected in the course of aninvestigation or an inquiry by a Commission of Inquiry and direct the Director General forthe Prevention of Bribery or Corruption to institute Crimianl Proceedings.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      346.51,
      455.91,
      393.62
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3: This clause amends section 27 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof that section as amended is to insert definitions for the expressions \u201cBribery Act\u201d,\u201cCommission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption\u201d, \u201cDeclaration of Assetsand Liabilities Law\u201d, \u201cDirector General\u201d, \u201claw enforcement authority\u201d, \u201cPenal Code\u201d and\u201cPrevention of Money Laundering Act\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
