      161.85,
      268.61,
      401.9,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      307.61,
      401.88,
      331.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Commissions of Inquiry(Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.61,
      401.89,
      409.91
    ],
    "text": "2.The Commissions of Inquiry Act (Chapter 393) ishereby amended by the insertion immediately after section24, of the following new sections and the new sections shallhave effect as sections 24A, 24B, 24C, 24D and 24E of thatenactment:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      424.61,
      401.9,
      604.91
    ],
    "text": "24A. (1) Notwithstanding anything to thecontrary in the Commission to InvestigateAllegations of Bribery or Corruption Act orany other written law, where the Commissionto Investigate Allegations of Bribery orCorruption, on a consideration of materialcollected in the course of an investigation orinquiry or both an investigation and inquiryas the case may be by a Commission of Inquiryappointed under section 2, is satisfied that anoffence under the following laws has beencommitted, it may direct the Director Generalto institute criminal proceedings in terms ofthe-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      222.57,
      619.61,
      290.86,
      630.95
    ],
    "text": "(a) Birbery Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      222.57,
      645.53,
      401.88,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "(b) Declaration of Assets and LiabilitiesLaw;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      348.91,
      455.01,
      405.98
    ],
    "text": "Insertion ofnew sections24A, 24B,24C, 24D, and24E toChapter 393.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
