      203.33,
      401.88,
      328.07
    ],
    "text": "24B. Notwithstanding anything to thecontrary in the Commission to InvestigateAllegations of Bribery or Corruption Act orany other written law, the Commission toInvestigate Allegations of Bribery orCorruption may, if it deems appropriate,forward the material collected and receivedunder section 24A to the Attorney-General orto any other authority to take any appropriateaction under any other written law.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
